# Only SOPS-encrypted files and this dir's docs may be committed. Plaintext/keys
# are blocked here AND by the repo root .gitignore (*secret*, *.key). The dir is
# named "enc" (not "secrets") so the encrypted, commit-intended *.sops.yaml files
# are not swept up by the root *secret* safety-net.
*
!.gitignore
!README.md
!*.sops.yaml
!nodes/
!nodes/*.sops.yaml
